    "Suggestions show names only; filling asks for Touch ID, saving asks you first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suggestions show names only; filling asks for Touch ID, saving asks you first."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las sugerencias solo muestran nombres; rellenar pide Touch ID y guardar te pregunta antes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les suggestions n’affichent que les noms ; le remplissage demande Touch ID, l’enregistrement vous demande d’abord."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "候補には名前のみ表示されます。入力には Touch ID が必要で、保存は先に確認します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "제안에는 이름만 표시됩니다. 입력할 때 Touch ID가 필요하고, 저장하기 전에 먼저 묻습니다."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "คำแนะนำแสดงเฉพาะชื่อ การกรอกจะขอ Touch ID และการบันทึกจะถามคุณก่อน"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建議只顯示名稱；填入需要 Touch ID，儲存前會先問你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建议只显示名称；填充需要 Touch ID，保存前会先询问你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建議只顯示名稱；填入需要 Touch ID，儲存前會先詢問你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
