    "Run the tool once through Triwarden to see the approval card and check that everything works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Triwarden 経由でツールを一度実行し、承認カードを確認して、すべて正しく動くか確かめます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 Triwarden 运行一次工具，查看批准卡片并确认一切正常。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透過 Triwarden 執行一次工具，查看核准卡片並確認一切正常。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "經 Triwarden 執行一次工具，睇吓批准卡片，確認一切正常。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Triwarden을 통해 도구를 한 번 실행하여 승인 카드를 보고 모든 것이 작동하는지 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lancez l'outil une fois via Triwarden pour voir la carte d'autorisation et vérifier que tout fonctionne."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ejecuta la herramienta una vez a través de Triwarden para ver la tarjeta de aprobación y comprobar que todo funciona."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เรียกใช้เครื่องมือผ่าน Triwarden หนึ่งครั้งเพื่อดูการ์ดอนุมัติและตรวจสอบว่าทุกอย่างทำงานได้"
          }
        }
      }
